      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "win! But if someone beats you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 927,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "to it, then it can't be helped."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 928,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "Anyway, it costs 1,000 zeny"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 929,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "to play each bingo game~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 932,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "[Arcade Owner]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 933,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "Ah, if you want to join a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 934,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "bingo game, enter the right"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 935,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "door. There must be at least"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 936,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "5 people to play a game, so"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 937,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "you may need to wait until"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 938,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "that requirement is fulfilled."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 940,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "[Arcade Owner]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 941,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "If you just want to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 942,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "watch the bingo game,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 943,
      "npc" : "Arcade Owner",
      "text" : "then you may enter the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
